  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "41718164",
      "title": "Getting Started with a Custom Image Picker Input Component",
      "sourceHash": "a3fc34441b283ccb909a596b85394d9c260d5780dfc286e594e5e611ec406cc5",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.54,
          "end": 3.72,
          "en": "So I got this IMAGE PICKER placeholder here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.72,
          "end": 7.71,
          "en": "and my idea here simply is to display an image picker",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.71,
          "end": 11.49,
          "en": "that can be used by the user to attach an image to the form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.49,
          "end": 15.06,
          "en": "and to upload an image when the form is submitted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.06,
          "end": 18.54,
          "en": "Now for that, I'll actually build a separate component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 18.54,
          "end": 21.9,
          "en": "since this image picker is a bit more complex,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 21.9,
          "end": 24.42,
          "en": "and hence, I'll go to this components folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 24.42,
          "end": 26.52,
          "en": "and then there in the meals folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.52,
          "end": 29.49,
          "en": "I'll add my image-picker.js file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 29.49,
          "end": 32.34,
          "en": "We could also add it in any other sub folder here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 32.34,
          "end": 34.29,
          "en": "but since I'm only using it in this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.29,
          "end": 36.753,
          "en": "meal-related form, I'll add it here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 38.07,
          "end": 41.76,
          "en": "Attached you also find an image-picker.module.css file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 41.76,
          "end": 43.713,
          "en": "with some styles we'll use.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 45,
          "end": 50,
          "en": "And then here we can and should export a component function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 51.57,
          "end": 56.57,
          "en": "that can be called ImagePicker like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 56.73,
          "end": 58.62,
          "en": "And the job of this component function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 58.62,
          "end": 60.57,
          "en": "is to output some markup",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 60.57,
          "end": 64.503,
          "en": "and then also handle the picking process.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 65.79,
          "end": 69.42,
          "en": "Now for the markup, I'll start with a div here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 69.42,
          "end": 73.56,
          "en": "with a class name of classes.picker.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 73.56,
          "end": 75.42,
          "en": "And for classes to be available,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 75.42,
          "end": 78.686,
          "en": "we should of course import classes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 78.686,
          "end": 83.013,
          "en": "from ./image-picker.module.css.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 85.17,
          "end": 88.953,
          "en": "And then in that div, I wanna start by adding a label,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 90.24,
          "end": 94.32,
          "en": "a label with a configurable text, which is expected",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 94.32,
          "end": 96.6,
          "en": "to be received via props.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 96.6,
          "end": 99.57,
          "en": "So I'll add the label prop here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 99.57,
          "end": 102.723,
          "en": "and then use that here for outputting that label text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 104.25,
          "end": 106.83,
          "en": "Now I will add the htmlFor prop here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 106.83,
          "end": 109.32,
          "en": "to connect this label to some input,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 109.32,
          "end": 111.93,
          "en": "and I'll connect it to an input with a name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 111.93,
          "end": 115.263,
          "en": "of image or with an ID of image to be precise.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 116.58,
          "end": 119.1,
          "en": "And therefore we of course also need such an input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 119.1,
          "end": 122.97,
          "en": "But I will nest that input into a div here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 122.97,
          "end": 127.653,
          "en": "a div to which I assign a className of controls.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 128.85,
          "end": 131.47,
          "en": "And then in there I wanna have an input element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 132.42,
          "end": 134.94,
          "en": "where the type should be set to file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 134.94,
          "end": 136.74,
          "en": "because this should be an input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 136.74,
          "end": 138.633,
          "en": "that allows us to select a file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 139.8,
          "end": 141.78,
          "en": "Now the ID here should be image",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 141.78,
          "end": 144.903,
          "en": "so that we connect this label to this input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 146.67000000000002,
          "end": 149.07,
          "en": "And I'll add the accept prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 149.07,
          "end": 151.89,
          "en": "to control which files are accepted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 151.89,
          "end": 154.07999999999998,
          "en": "And here I only wanna accept files that are",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 154.07999999999998,
          "end": 157.98,
          "en": "of type image/png or image/jpeg,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 157.98,
          "end": 160.2,
          "en": "so no other files can be uploaded",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 160.2,
          "end": 161.493,
          "en": "with help of that picker.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 162.42000000000002,
          "end": 166.44,
          "en": "I'll also give this input a name of image,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 166.44,
          "end": 169.44,
          "en": "which will later be important for extracting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 169.44,
          "end": 170.823,
          "en": "that uploaded image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 172.17000000000002,
          "end": 174.69,
          "en": "Alternatively, we can also make this image picker",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 174.69,
          "end": 177.39,
          "en": "a bit more configurable by accepting that name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 177.39,
          "end": 180.663,
          "en": "as a prop and then setting this like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 182.64,
          "end": 186.6,
          "en": "We could now also use this name as a value for the ID",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 186.6,
          "end": 188.67,
          "en": "to make this even more configurable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 188.67,
          "end": 190.83,
          "en": "And I will do that here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 190.83,
          "end": 193.623,
          "en": "Also using it here for htmlFor.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 196.95,
          "end": 200.31,
          "en": "Now with that, we got a very basic unfinished version,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 200.31,
          "end": 204.3,
          "en": "but we can now use this image picker in our form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 204.3,
          "end": 207.42000000000002,
          "en": "So back in page.js, in this form here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 207.42000000000002,
          "end": 209.22,
          "en": "where I have this image picker,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 209.22,
          "end": 211.52,
          "en": "we can output the ImagePicker",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 212.4,
          "end": 215.463,
          "en": "using our own custom ImagePicker component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 216.72,
          "end": 218.7,
          "en": "Of course, for that, you must import it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 218.7,
          "end": 220.44299999999998,
          "en": "from that components folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 222.51,
          "end": 225.78300000000002,
          "en": "And with that added, you will see that image picker here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 227.22,
          "end": 229.32,
          "en": "Now this would work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 229.32,
          "end": 232.89,
          "en": "You could now click it and then select images.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 232.89,
          "end": 235.47,
          "en": "But I actually wanna make this image picker",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 235.47,
          "end": 236.94,
          "en": "a bit more fancy.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 236.94,
          "end": 240,
          "en": "I wanna make sure that it also shows a preview",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 240,
          "end": 241.62,
          "en": "of the picked image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 241.62,
          "end": 244.71,
          "en": "And I wanna get rid of this ugly button here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 244.71,
          "end": 247.05,
          "en": "and instead display my own button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 247.05,
          "end": 249.243,
          "en": "over which I have full control.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 250.74,
          "end": 254.73,
          "en": "And therefore, back here in the image-picker.js file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 254.73,
          "end": 259.26,
          "en": "we can start by adding a class here to this input,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 259.26,
          "end": 261.423,
          "en": "and that should be the input class.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 262.29,
          "end": 264.54,
          "en": "And this class will essentially make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 264.54,
          "end": 267.24,
          "en": "that the input itself is hidden.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 267.24,
          "end": 270.15,
          "en": "So now we can't see it anymore down there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 270.15,
          "end": 273.243,
          "en": "because I instead now wanna render my own button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 274.47,
          "end": 277.44,
          "en": "So therefore here, maybe after the input,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 277.44,
          "end": 278.883,
          "en": "we can output a button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 279.81,
          "end": 283.9,
          "en": "which should receive a class of button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 285.9,
          "end": 289.5,
          "en": "and which should be of type button, which is important",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 289.5,
          "end": 293.25,
          "en": "so that it won't submit the surrounding form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 293.25,
          "end": 295.2,
          "en": "If you would not set the type,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 295.2,
          "end": 297.87,
          "en": "it would by default be type submit,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 297.87,
          "end": 300.57,
          "en": "and it would submit the surrounding form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 300.57,
          "end": 303.45,
          "en": "which I don't want to happen here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 303.45,
          "end": 304.923,
          "en": "So the type should be button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 306.24,
          "end": 307.53,
          "en": "And then we can set a text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 307.53,
          "end": 310.293,
          "en": "of pick an image here on that button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 312.9,
          "end": 315.87,
          "en": "Now with that, we got this button here, which is great,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 315.87,
          "end": 318.99,
          "en": "but of course the button isn't doing anything.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 318.99,
          "end": 323.7,
          "en": "And what I want the button to do is click this input,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 323.7,
          "end": 326.58,
          "en": "which is not visible anymore for me.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 326.58,
          "end": 328.26,
          "en": "It's still part of the DOM.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 328.26,
          "end": 329.55,
          "en": "It's just not visible",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 329.55,
          "end": 332.61,
          "en": "because of the CSS styles I applied",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 332.61,
          "end": 334.56,
          "en": "and now I wanna use my own button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 334.56,
          "end": 337.89,
          "en": "to click this input under the hood so that I still",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 337.89,
          "end": 340.32,
          "en": "leverage this input, but I don't show it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 340.32,
          "end": 342.273,
          "en": "because it's not looking that nice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 343.731,
          "end": 346.26,
          "en": "Now to make that work, we of course need",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 346.26,
          "end": 348.24,
          "en": "to handle clicks on this button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 348.24,
          "end": 352.023,
          "en": "and then forward them, so to say, to this input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 353.49,
          "end": 356.58,
          "en": "Now we can handle clicks to this button by adding a",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 356.58,
          "end": 360.7,
          "en": "function here to our image picker, like handlePickClick",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 362.49,
          "end": 363.603,
          "en": "or anything like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 365.4,
          "end": 368.04,
          "en": "And now we can assign this function as a value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 368.04,
          "end": 371.733,
          "en": "for the onClick prop here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 374.28,
          "end": 377.43,
          "en": "Now if you do that, you'll be greeted by an error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 377.43,
          "end": 380.31,
          "en": "because as I briefly mentioned earlier,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 380.31,
          "end": 382.26,
          "en": "event handlers like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 382.26,
          "end": 384.93,
          "en": "so whenever you are assigning a function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 384.93,
          "end": 387.48,
          "en": "or any value to the onClick prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 387.48,
          "end": 390.72,
          "en": "or any other event handling prop cannot be used",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 390.72,
          "end": 394.29,
          "en": "in server components, which kind of makes sense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 394.29,
          "end": 396.99,
          "en": "because those interactions happen on the client",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 396.99,
          "end": 398.25,
          "en": "in the browser.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 398.25,
          "end": 401.433,
          "en": "The user clicks on the button in the browser.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 402.48,
          "end": 405.27,
          "en": "Therefore, we must mark this ImagePicker",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 405.27,
          "end": 406.89,
          "en": "as a client component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 406.89,
          "end": 409.17,
          "en": "by adding this use client directive",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 409.17,
          "end": 410.523,
          "en": "at the top of this file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 412.68,
          "end": 414.633,
          "en": "With that done, the error goes away,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 415.61,
          "end": 417.27,
          "en": "but of course, we're not doing anything",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 417.27,
          "end": 419.34000000000003,
          "en": "when the user clicks the button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 419.34000000000003,
          "end": 423.12,
          "en": "What I wanna do is, as mentioned, forward that click.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 423.12,
          "end": 425.97,
          "en": "I wanna trigger a click on this input,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 425.97,
          "end": 429.24,
          "en": "and we can do that with help of refs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 429.24,
          "end": 431.79,
